    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "body": "Audit result: worthwhile as a modular pack, but the candidates are six unrelated mechanisms. Nexus 4909 restores specific v1.00 clothing physics assets; 1425 repairs corn-sack carry physics; 1197 repairs the timer “Message” regression; 704 is a run/walk-toggle ASI; 2953 corrects a misnamed Wickiup minimap YTD; 9006 removes a completed Dreamcatchers entry through an ASI. Ship each independently and verify against current files. Recreate from vanilla/current assets or obtain permission: most cited pages restrict reuse; 2953 explicitly allows credited reuse. Best first targets are Wickiup and Dreamcatcher cleanup; clothing/corn need asset regression comparisons, while toggle-run is QoL rather than a Rockstar bug.",
